msgstr ""
"**STMicroelectronics model zoo**\\ -katalogen utökad till "
"``OPENMV_RT1060``\\ , ``OPENMV4P``\\ , ``ARDUINO_GIGA``\\ , "
"``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7`` och ``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION`` utöver ``OPENMV_AE3`` "
"och ``OPENMV_N6``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:87
